rad : GraphCalc.HasRadius G) (hnt : GraphCalc.IsNontrivialClass G) :\n103:     GraphCalc.radius G + 1 ≤ Fintype.card V\n104: ```\n105: \n106: All lemmas pass `check.sh` cleanly with exit code 0.\n107: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
